<title>MALAYSIA: Sri Hartamas 18-mth net up 9.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Hartamas 18-mth net up 9.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eighteen months to June</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		93.30	  vs	    85.21</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents)  17.09	  vs	    15.61</p>
<p>    Dividend		   nil	   vs	     nil</p>
<p>    Turnover		 758.97	  vs	   143.66</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  99.48	  vs	    86.04</p>
<p>    Minorities		 0.08	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE: The company's full name is Sri Hartamas Corporation Bhd. It said the accounting period was changed after its reorganisation to a group structure.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
